{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-15","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If three numbers in continued proportion be the least of those which have the same ratio with them, any two whatever added together will be prime to the remaining number.","book":9,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","contentId":"euclid-9-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28b606e264f68c10dba47a46a5d7125e3e1d0fa3389aa0027b691d6850c41920","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-15.statement","euclid-9-15.construction.1","euclid-9-15.construction.2","euclid-9-15.proof.1","euclid-9-15.proof.2","euclid-9-15.proof.3","euclid-9-15.proof.4","euclid-9-15.proof.5","euclid-9-15.proof.6","euclid-9-15.proof.7","euclid-9-15.proof.8","euclid-9-15.proof.9","euclid-9-15.proof.10","euclid-9-15.proof.11","euclid-9-15.proof.12","euclid-9-15.proof.13","euclid-9-15.proof.14","euclid-9-15.conclusion","euclid-9-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc32eb291b0f41e5e28b557d5d7ca0cdd3ba27ced392ced8c5ff624362a19f65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If three numbers in continued proportion be the least of those which have the same ratio with them, any two whatever added together will be prime to the remaining number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果连比例的三个数字是与其相同比例的最小数字,那么,任何两个加在一起的数字,都将是其余数字的首选数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"860d903587f727c6e39eac08cd75b10b2f6a1c5b5cbf3b7cad69db03f83105a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, three numbers in continued proportion, be the least of those which have the same ratio with them; I say that any two of the numbers A, B, C whatever added together are prime to the remaining number, namely A, B to C; B, C to A; and further A, C to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让连比例的A、B、C、3个数字,至少是与其相同比的A、B、C和C数字中的任何两个数字,无论加在一起,都是剩余数字的首选数字,即A、B至C;B、C至A;以及A、C至B;以及A、C至B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b14d54665e4000e663068e565e8dc5b1787397c4c2dc5d438d939445c97d4ac","citations":["euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two numbers DE, EF, the least of those which have the same ratio with A, B, C, be taken. [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以2个DE,EF, 最少是A,B,C的相同比例。 [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2db3d2829ec93cec0ef580344ad1f4f88c008d744098d614ca064a2ca1d6033","citations":["euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that DE by multiplying itself has made A, and by multiplying EF has made B, and, further, EF by multiplying itself has made C. [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可见,DE乘以本身就已形成A,EF乘以本身就形成了B,EF乘以本身也形成了C。 [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e2679f14937ef604f01744c06ee5bb6edd9d8aacd9e93a060cd7f0298a1a01b","citations":["euclid-7-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DE, EF are least, they are prime to one another. [[VII. 22](/principles/euclid-7-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,DE,EF是最少的,它们互素。 [[VII. 22](/principles/euclid-7-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"967bffd19b0a59829f7be53e5ccb79bc6c6c83b0159e5bb73aa1f51694889261","citations":["euclid-7-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two numbers be prime to one another, their sum is also prime to each; [[VII. 28](/principles/euclid-7-28)] therefore DF is also prime to each of the numbers DE, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果两个数字是互素, 它们的金额也是每个数字的首当其冲; 因此,DF也是DE,EF的首当其冲。 [[VII. 28](/principles/euclid-7-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7205c9c57798414a30413f7bc911f0dd70da154acbdba6f0c3a550102e6a2ea5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further DE is also prime to EF; therefore DF, DE are prime to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但还有DE也达到EF;因此,DF,DE达到EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8fcbc87fdf8974723e90f4e50a3b09c86450fffb63e85fc41b19a20be87a1781","citations":["euclid-7-24","euclid-7-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two numbers be prime to any number, their product is also prime to the other; [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)] so that the product of FD, DE is prime to EF; hence the product of FD, DE is also prime to the square on EF. [[VII. 25](/principles/euclid-7-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果两个数字是任何一个数字的首选数字,它们的产品也是另一个数字的首选数字;因此,FD,DE的产值是EF的首选数字;因此,FD,DE的产值也是EF的首选数字是平方数。 [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)] [[VII. 25](/principles/euclid-7-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d81f47a0c5feaac998f3239753bd0d8dd26bb59d84d97de2299e2aa552f7db98","citations":["euclid-2-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of FD, DE is the square on DE together with the product of DE, EF; [[II. 3](/principles/euclid-2-3)] therefore the square on DE together with the product of DE, EF is prime to the square on EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FD,DE的产物是DE的平方数,DE的产物是DE,EF的产物;因此,DE的平方数,DE的产物是DE,EF的平方数,这是EF的平方数的产物。 [[II. 3](/principles/euclid-2-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00ff009d41e514b4db0de7c209effe59b2f9381fb00543bb93c00a260338aef6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on DE is A, the product of DE, EF is B, and the square on EF is C; therefore A, B added together are prime to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE的平方数是A,DE的产物,EF的产物是B,EF的平方数是C;因此,A,B的加在一起是C的产物。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cbdc38f605feea609e79777e47c0c7e5bd7f2a6babb54476c33c7496d7b5fc1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that B, C added together are prime to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,B,C加在一起是A的质数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c0217a7969dbd1e64d5b15206aecbff0317ed69b80db183bf865a7edf40de49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that A, C added together are also prime to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,A,C加在一起 也是B的黄金。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"832a141558245e4be1500286024a82966742dbec911aa6e310a9a17ecfbecf06","citations":["euclid-7-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since DF is prime to each of the numbers DE, EF, the square on DF is also prime to the product of DE, EF. [[VII. 24, 25](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为DF是DE,EF的首选,DF的平方数也是DE,EF的首选产品。 [[VII. 24, 25](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a2bb7ca2d9a7d77d30b9dfdea73c3fed2019b9d6575815e6a8fc202d9970e61","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on DE, EF together with twice the product of DE, EF are equal to the square on DF; [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)] therefore the squares on DE, EF together with twice the product of DE, EF are prime to the product of DE, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,DE,EF的平方数和DE的两倍产品,EF的DE和DF的平方数,因此,DE,EF的平方数和DE的两倍产品,是DE,EF的EF的产值。 [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"645deabdd94773b967ef7997c014ffc6911f56bb7c4f0a8a1ad8a24be945fa18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Separando, the squares on DE, EF together with once the product of DE, EF are prime to the product of DE, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE,EF平方数 DE,EF产品 与DE,EF产品一起 成为DE,EF产品的主要产品"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49034da6d4bb407ea31d8fa0cfb91c55e701d6dcf6e379ed291922522dd02cc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, separando again, the squares on DE, EF are prime to the product of DE, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,塞帕兰多,平方数对DE,EF是DE,EF的产物。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bf60232d5b0b3b299d887879490a7a5d1992389d2ff13df5e494e2b77dde52e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on DE is A, the product of DE, EF is B, and the square on EF is C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE的平方数是A,DE的产物,EF的产物是B,EF的产物是DE,EF的平方数是C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8a8ccabaa3bdfb9f8fd8d986070ecb365c9815878eb667f99007d19cbc17f4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, C added together are prime to B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,C加在一起是B,Q,E,D的黄金。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-15.source","contentId":"euclid-9-15","revisionId":"euclid-9-15@raw-28b606e264f68c10","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d00d42efa83dc0069616bfd63ea90af2f2cda0b86991f60bbd6472a1e4d1d926","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-15:euclid-8-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-15.construction.2","euclid-9-15.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-15:euclid-7-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-15.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"VII. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-15:euclid-7-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-15.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"VII. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euc